}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"kkiwldv\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_inline_size\":\"85.821\",\"_column_size\":50},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"hgpgoln\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"color\":\"rgba(117,117,117,0.37)\",\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"5\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"yclc7am\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; font-size: 13px; background: #ffffff; color: #757575; font-family: \'DM Sans\', sans-serif;\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent;\\\">REGULAMIN SKLEPU INTERNETOWEGO<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; font-size: 13px; background: #ffffff; color: #757575; font-family: \'DM Sans\', sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">www.winohobby.biz<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"_margin\":{\"0\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"rekphue\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; font-size: 13px; background: #ffffff; color: #757575; font-family: \'DM Sans\', sans-serif;\\\"><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">\\u00a71. POSTANOWIENIA OG\\u00d3LNE<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">1. Sklep internetowy dost\\u0119pny pod adresem internetowym www.winohobby.bizprowadzony jest przez firm\\u0119 ARES R.E. Wawrowscy Sp. J., ul.\\u00a0Cie\\u015blewskich 37Z, 03-017 Warszawa, NIP:113-25-29-689.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">2. Definicje:<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">a) Sklep internetowy \\u2013 sklep internetowy Sprzedawcy dost\\u0119pny pod adresem: www.winohobby.biz,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">b) Regulamin \\u2013 niniejszy regulamin Sklepu internetowego,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">c) Sprzedawca \\u2013 ARES R.E.Wawrowscy Sp.J.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">d) Kupuj\\u0105cy \\u2013 osoba fizyczna, osoba prawna lub jednostka organizacyjna nieposiadaj\\u0105ca osobowo\\u015bci prawnej, kt\\u00f3ra korzysta z us\\u0142ug \\u015bwiadczonych drog\\u0105 elektroniczn\\u0105 przez Sprzedawc\\u0119,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">e) Formularz rejestracji \\u2013 dost\\u0119pny w Sklepie internetowym formularz, umo\\u017cliwiaj\\u0105cy utworzenie Konta,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">f) Konto - oznaczony indywidualn\\u0105 nazw\\u0105 (loginem) i has\\u0142em podanym przez Kupuj\\u0105cego, zbi\\u00f3r zasob\\u00f3w w systemie teleinformatycznym Sprzedawcy, w kt\\u00f3rym gromadzone s\\u0105 dane Kupuj\\u0105cego, w tym informacje o z\\u0142o\\u017conych Zam\\u00f3wieniach,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">g) Formularz zam\\u00f3wienia - dost\\u0119pny w Sklepie internetowym formularz, umo\\u017cliwiaj\\u0105cy z\\u0142o\\u017cenie Zam\\u00f3wienia,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">h) Zam\\u00f3wienie - o\\u015bwiadczenie woli Kupuj\\u0105cego, stanowi\\u0105ce ofert\\u0119 zawarcia umowy sprzeda\\u017cy Produktu ze Sprzedawc\\u0105,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">i) Produkt - dost\\u0119pna w Sklepie internetowym rzecz ruchoma, b\\u0119d\\u0105ca przedmiotem umowy sprzeda\\u017cy pomi\\u0119dzy Kupuj\\u0105cym a Sprzedawc\\u0105 \\u2013 artyku\\u0142y dekoracyjne, chemia gospodarcza, artyku\\u0142y papiernicze, prezenty okoliczno\\u015bciowe, materia\\u0142y pirotechniczne,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">j) Dow\\u00f3d zakupu \\u2013 paragon fiskalny lub faktura VAT,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">k) Za\\u0142\\u0105cznik nr 1 \\u2013 do\\u0142\\u0105czony do Regulaminu dokument umo\\u017cliwiaj\\u0105cy z\\u0142o\\u017cenie Zam\\u00f3wienia za pomoc\\u0105, poczty elektronicznej e-mail, faxu,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">l) Za\\u0142\\u0105cznik nr 2 - do\\u0142\\u0105czony do Regulaminu dokument umo\\u017cliwiaj\\u0105cy odst\\u0105pienie od umowy, o kt\\u00f3rym mowa w \\u00a77,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">3. Wype\\u0142nienie Formularza rejestracji oraz utworzenie Konta jest to\\u017csame z zapoznaniem si\\u0119 Kupuj\\u0105cego z tre\\u015bci\\u0105 Regulaminu oraz jego akceptacj\\u0105.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">4. Og\\u0142oszenia, reklamy Sprzedawcy, cenniki i inne informacje o Produktach, podane na stronach internetowych Sklepu internetowego, w szczeg\\u00f3lno\\u015bci ich opisy, parametry techniczne i u\\u017cytkowe oraz ceny, stanowi\\u0105 zaproszenie do zawarcia umowy w rozumieniu art. 71 Kodeksu Cywilnego z dnia 23 kwietnia 1964 r. (Dz. U. Nr 16, poz. 93 ze zm.).<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">5. Postanowienia niniejszego Regulaminu nie maj\\u0105 na celu wy\\u0142\\u0105cza\\u0107 ani ogranicza\\u0107 jakichkolwiek praw Klienta b\\u0119d\\u0105cego jednocze\\u015bnie Konsumentem w rozumieniu przepis\\u00f3w ustawy z dnia 23 kwietnia 1964 roku - Kodeks Cywilny (Dz. U. nr 16, poz. 93 ze zm.), przys\\u0142uguj\\u0105cych mu na mocy bezwzgl\\u0119dnie obowi\\u0105zuj\\u0105cych przepis\\u00f3w prawa. W przypadku niezgodno\\u015bci postanowie\\u0144 niniejszego Regulaminu z powy\\u017cszymi przepisami, pierwsze\\u0144stwo maj\\u0105 te przepisy.<\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">\\u00a72. WARUNKI Z\\u0141O\\u017bENIA ZAM\\u00d3WIENIA<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">1. Sklep internetowy prowadzi sprzeda\\u017c na terenie Rzeczypospolitej Polskiej.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">2. Zam\\u00f3wienia mo\\u017cna sk\\u0142ada\\u0107 7 dni w tygodniu przez 24 godziny na dob\\u0119 (z wy\\u0142\\u0105czeniem zam\\u00f3wie\\u0144 sk\\u0142adanych telefonicznie).<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">3. Kupuj\\u0105cy mo\\u017ce wybra\\u0107 jeden spo\\u015br\\u00f3d nast\\u0119puj\\u0105cych sposob\\u00f3w sk\\u0142adania Zam\\u00f3wienia:<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">a) z\\u0142o\\u017cenie Zam\\u00f3wienia poprzez wype\\u0142nienie Formularza zam\\u00f3wienia na stronie internetowej Sklepu internetowego,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">b) z\\u0142o\\u017cenie Zam\\u00f3wienia drog\\u0105 poczty elektronicznej \\u2013 email: sklep@winohobby.pl,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">c) z\\u0142o\\u017cenie Zam\\u00f3wienia drog\\u0105 telefoniczn\\u0105 pod numer 22741 31 30,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">4. Zam\\u00f3wienia, o kt\\u00f3rych mowa w pkt 3a niniejszego paragrafu, z\\u0142o\\u017cone w dni powszednie po godzinie 16:00, w soboty, niedziele oraz dni ustawowo wolne od pracy, b\\u0119d\\u0105 rozpatrywane nast\\u0119pnego dnia roboczego.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">5. Zam\\u00f3wienia przekazane do realizacji mog\\u0105 by\\u0107 anulowane do momentu wysy\\u0142ki towaru. Przepis ten dotyczy wy\\u0142\\u0105cznie Kupuj\\u0105cych b\\u0119d\\u0105cych osobami fizycznymi. W przypadku pozosta\\u0142ych Kupuj\\u0105cych Zam\\u00f3wienia nie mog\\u0105 by\\u0107 anulowane.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">6. \\u015aredni czas realizacji Zam\\u00f3wienia (od z\\u0142o\\u017cenia do wys\\u0142ania do Kupuj\\u0105cego) wynosi: 24 godziny w przypadku wybrania opcji wysy\\u0142ki za pobraniem lub\\u00a048 godziny od zaksi\\u0119gowania wp\\u0142aty na koncie w przypadku wybrania przesy\\u0142ki po przelewie (z wy\\u0142\\u0105czeniem sob\\u00f3t i\\u00a0dni \\u015bwi\\u0105tecznych).<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">7. W przypadku braku zam\\u00f3wionych Produkt\\u00f3w w magazynie, Kupuj\\u0105cy jest informowany o tym fakcie i zwi\\u0105zanym z tym wyd\\u0142u\\u017ceniem czasu realizacji Zam\\u00f3wienia niezw\\u0142ocznie, najp\\u00f3\\u017aniej w ci\\u0105gu 48 godzin.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">8. W sytuacji, o kt\\u00f3rej mowa w powy\\u017cszym punkcie, Kupuj\\u0105cy mo\\u017ce wyrazi\\u0107 zgod\\u0119 na wyd\\u0142u\\u017cenie czasu realizacji Zam\\u00f3wienia (do 14 dni) lub zrezygnowa\\u0107 z zam\\u00f3wionego Produktu albo z ca\\u0142o\\u015bci Zam\\u00f3wienia.<\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">\\u00a73. P\\u0141ATNO\\u015aCI<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">1. Ceny podane w Sklepie internetowym wyra\\u017cone s\\u0105 w polskich z\\u0142otych i s\\u0105 cenami brutto (zawieraj\\u0105 podatek VAT).<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">2. Do ka\\u017cdego Zam\\u00f3wienia do\\u0142\\u0105czany jest Dow\\u00f3d zakupu.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">3. Kupuj\\u0105cy nie b\\u0119d\\u0105cy osob\\u0105 fizyczn\\u0105, w celu realizacji Zam\\u00f3wienia o\\u015bwiadcza, i\\u017c jest p\\u0142atnikiem podatku VAT oraz upowa\\u017cnia Sprzedawc\\u0119 do wystawiania Dowodu zakupu bez podpisu odbiorcy.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">4. Wyboru p\\u0142atno\\u015bci dokonuje Kupuj\\u0105cy podczas sk\\u0142adania Zam\\u00f3wienia. Kupuj\\u0105cy mo\\u017ce wybra\\u0107 jeden z mo\\u017cliwych sposob\\u00f3w p\\u0142atno\\u015bci:<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">a) p\\u0142atno\\u015b\\u0107 za pobraniem<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">b) p\\u0142atno\\u015b\\u0107 przelewem na konto Sprzedaj\\u0105cego<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">c) p\\u0142atno\\u015b\\u0107 got\\u00f3wk\\u0105 (przy odbiorze towaru)<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">d) szybkie przelewy on-line. Podmiotem \\u015bwiadcz\\u0105cym obs\\u0142ug\\u0119 p\\u0142atno\\u015bci online jest Blue Media S.A.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">5. Sprzedawca zastrzega sobie prawo do dokonywania zmiany cen Produkt\\u00f3w.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">6. Zam\\u00f3wienia z\\u0142o\\u017cone przed wej\\u015bciem w \\u017cycie zmian, o kt\\u00f3rych mowa w powy\\u017cszym punkcie, realizowane b\\u0119d\\u0105 na zasadach obowi\\u0105zuj\\u0105cych w momencie ich sk\\u0142adania.<\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">\\u00a74. DOSTAWA<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">1. Kupuj\\u0105cy mo\\u017ce wybra\\u0107 nast\\u0119puj\\u0105ce sposoby odbioru zam\\u00f3wionych Produkt\\u00f3w:<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">a) dostarczenie Produkt\\u00f3w na adres kupuj\\u0105cego podany podczas sk\\u0142adania Zam\\u00f3wienia przez firm\\u0119 kuriersk\\u0105,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">b) dostarczenie Produkt\\u00f3w na adres kupuj\\u0105cego podany podczas sk\\u0142adania Zam\\u00f3wienia przez Poczt\\u0119 Polsk\\u0105,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">c) odbi\\u00f3r osobisty,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">2. Wyb\\u00f3r sposobu dostarczenia przesy\\u0142ki dokonywany jest przez Kupuj\\u0105cego podczas sk\\u0142adania Zam\\u00f3wienia.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">3. Koszty wysy\\u0142ki naliczane s\\u0105 zgodnie z aktualnymi cennikami i zale\\u017c\\u0105 od wagi oraz rozmiar\\u00f3w przesy\\u0142ki i sposobu pakowania. Kupuj\\u0105cy jest informowany o kosztach wysy\\u0142ki podczas sk\\u0142adania Zam\\u00f3wienia.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">4. Koszty dostawy ponosi Kupuj\\u0105cy.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">5. Kupuj\\u0105cy zobowi\\u0105zuje si\\u0119 do odebrania wys\\u0142anego Produktu.<\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">\\u00a75. REKLAMACJA<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">1. Reklamacje nale\\u017cy kierowa\\u0107 mailowo:\\u00a0<a href=\\\"mailto:biuro@areshurt.pl\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; color: #606060; text-decoration-line: none;\\\">biuro@areshurt.pl<\\/a>, pisemnie na adres: Firma ARES, ul.Cie\\u015blewskich 37Z, 03-017 Warszawa lub telefonicznie 22 614 17 65.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">2. Do reklamowanego Produktu zaleca si\\u0119 do\\u0142\\u0105czy\\u0107 Dow\\u00f3d zakupu lub jego kopi\\u0119 \\u2013 znacznie u\\u0142atwi to procedur\\u0119 reklamacji. Nie do\\u0142\\u0105czenie dowodu zakupu lub jego kopii nie wstrzymuje procedury reklamacyjnej.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">3. Kupuj\\u0105cy zobowi\\u0105zany jest do odes\\u0142ania reklamowanego Produktu na w\\u0142asny koszt. W przypadku uwzgl\\u0119dnienia reklamacji koszty wysy\\u0142ki s\\u0105 zwracane.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">4. Nieznaczne r\\u00f3\\u017cnice wynikaj\\u0105ce z indywidualnych ustawie\\u0144 komputera Kupuj\\u0105cego nie mog\\u0105 by\\u0107 podstaw\\u0105 do reklamacji zakupionego Produktu.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">5. W przypadku stwierdzenia, i\\u017c Produkt jest wadliwy, Klient obowi\\u0105zany jest poinformowa\\u0107 o tym Sprzedawc\\u0119 w przeci\\u0105gu 2 miesi\\u0119cy od daty stwierdzenia niezgodno\\u015bci Produktu z umow\\u0105.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">6. Sprzedawca zobowi\\u0105zuje si\\u0119 do ustosunkowania si\\u0119 do z\\u0142o\\u017conej przez Klienta reklamacji w przeci\\u0105gu 14 dni. Brak odpowiedzi ze strony Sprzedawcy po up\\u0142ywie wskazanego w poprzednim zdaniu terminu skutkuje uznaniem reklamacji za uzasadnion\\u0105.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">7.\\u00a0W\\u00a0przypadku zwrotu z szybkiego przelewu i\\/lub karty p\\u0142atniczej, kwota zostanie zwr\\u00f3cona na rachunek bankowy podpi\\u0119ty pod w\\/w metod\\u0119 p\\u0142atno\\u015bci.<br \\/><br \\/>\\u00a0<\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">\\u00a76. ODST\\u0104PIENIE OD UMOWY<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">1. Kupuj\\u0105cemu, kt\\u00f3ry jest Konsumentem w rozumieniu ustawy z dnia 2 marca 2000 roku o ochronie niekt\\u00f3rych praw konsument\\u00f3w oraz odpowiedzialno\\u015bci za szkod\\u0119 wyrz\\u0105dzon\\u0105 przez produkt niebezpieczny (Dz. U. nr 22, poz. 271 ze zm.), przys\\u0142uguje prawo odst\\u0105pienia od umowy zawartej na odleg\\u0142o\\u015b\\u0107, bez podania przyczyny, w terminie 14 dni od dnia otrzymania towaru.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">2. Uprawnienie powy\\u017csze nie przys\\u0142uguje Konsumentowi w nast\\u0119puj\\u0105cych przypadkach:<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">a) \\u015bwiadczenia us\\u0142ug rozpocz\\u0119tego, za zgod\\u0105 Konsumenta, przed up\\u0142ywem terminu, o kt\\u00f3rym mowa w powy\\u017cszym punkcie,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">b) dotycz\\u0105cych nagra\\u0144 audialnych i wizualnych oraz zapisanych na informatycznych no\\u015bnikach danych po usuni\\u0119ciu przez konsumenta ich oryginalnego opakowania,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">c) um\\u00f3w dotycz\\u0105cych \\u015bwiadcze\\u0144, za kt\\u00f3re cena lub wynagrodzenie zale\\u017cy wy\\u0142\\u0105cznie od ruchu cen na rynku finansowym,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">d) \\u015bwiadcze\\u0144 o w\\u0142a\\u015bciwo\\u015bciach okre\\u015blonych przez konsumenta w z\\u0142o\\u017conym przez niego zam\\u00f3wieniu lub \\u015bci\\u015ble zwi\\u0105zanych z jego osob\\u0105,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">e) \\u015bwiadcze\\u0144, kt\\u00f3re z uwagi na ich charakter nie mog\\u0105 zosta\\u0107 zwr\\u00f3cone lub kt\\u00f3rych przedmiot ulega szybkiemu zepsuciu,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">f) dostarczania prasy,<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">g) us\\u0142ug w zakresie gier hazardowych.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">3. Postanowienia niniejszego paragrafu nie stosuje si\\u0119 do Kupuj\\u0105cych b\\u0119d\\u0105cych osobami prawnymi oraz jednostkami organizacyjnymi nieposiadaj\\u0105cymi osobowo\\u015bci prawnej.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">4. Do skutecznego odst\\u0105pienia od umowy, o kt\\u00f3rym mowa w pkt 1 niniejszego paragrafu, wystarczy z\\u0142o\\u017cenie pisemnego o\\u015bwiadczenia przez Kupuj\\u0105cego drog\\u0105 mailow\\u0105 lub pocztow\\u0105, w przypisanym ustawowo 10-dniowym terminie. Wz\\u00f3r o\\u015bwiadczenia zawiera Za\\u0142\\u0105cznik nr 1.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">5. Kupuj\\u0105cy, odst\\u0119puj\\u0105c od umowy, zobowi\\u0105zany jest do zwrotu Produktu w stanie niezmienionym, wraz z Dowodem zakupu lub jego kopi\\u0105, w terminie 14 dni od daty z\\u0142o\\u017cenia odst\\u0105pienia.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">6. Sprzedawca gwarantuje zwrot ceny Produktu oraz koszt\\u00f3w wysy\\u0142ki Produktu do Kupuj\\u0105cego niezw\\u0142ocznie, nie p\\u00f3\\u017aniej ni\\u017c w terminie 14 dni, na konto bankowe wskazane przez Kupuj\\u0105cego lub przekazem pocztowym na adres wskazany w Zam\\u00f3wieniu. Koszty wysy\\u0142ki zwracanego Produktu ponosi Kupuj\\u0105cy.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">7. W przypadku Kupuj\\u0105cych b\\u0119d\\u0105cych osobami prawnymi oraz jednostkami organizacyjnymi nie posiadaj\\u0105cymi osobowo\\u015bci prawnej odst\\u0105pienie od umowy w powy\\u017cszym zakresie jest ca\\u0142kowicie wy\\u0142\\u0105czone \\u2013 prosimy o rozwa\\u017cne i przemy\\u015blane zakupy.<\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">\\u00a77. POSTANOWIENIA KO\\u0143COWE<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">1. Sprzedawca zastrzega sobie prawo do wprowadzenia ogranicze\\u0144 w korzystaniu ze Sklepu internetowego spowodowanych jego serwisem technicznym, pracami konserwacyjnymi lub pracami nad polepszeniem jego funkcjonalno\\u015bci. Jednocze\\u015bnie Sprzedawca zobowi\\u0105zuje si\\u0119 do do\\u0142o\\u017cenia wszelkich stara\\u0144, by wspomniane przerwy odbywa\\u0142y si\\u0119 w godzinach nocnych i trwa\\u0142y jak najkr\\u00f3cej.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">2. Sprzedawca zastrzega sobie prawo do zmiany Regulaminu. Zmiany obowi\\u0105zuj\\u0105 z chwil\\u0105 ich og\\u0142oszenia na stronie internetowej Sklepu internetowego.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">3. Zam\\u00f3wienia z\\u0142o\\u017cone przed wej\\u015bciem w \\u017cycie zmian, o kt\\u00f3rych mowa w powy\\u017cszym punkcie, b\\u0119d\\u0105 realizowane na zasadach obowi\\u0105zuj\\u0105cych w momencie ich sk\\u0142adania.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">4. Zwroty Produkt\\u00f3w wysy\\u0142ane na koszt Sprzedawcy lub za pobraniem nie b\\u0119d\\u0105 przyjmowane.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">5. W sprawach nieuregulowanych niniejszym Regulaminem zastosowanie b\\u0119d\\u0105 mia\\u0142y w\\u0142a\\u015bciwe przepisy prawa, w szczeg\\u00f3lno\\u015bci ustawy z dnia 23 kwietnia 1964 roku - Kodeks Cywilny (Dz. U. nr 16, poz. 93 ze zm.), ustawy z dnia 27 lipca 2002 roku o szczeg\\u00f3lnych warunkach sprzeda\\u017cy konsumenckiej oraz o zmianie Kodeksu Cywilnego (Dz. U. nr 141, poz. 1176 ze zm.) oraz ustawy z dnia 2 marca 2000 roku o ochronie niekt\\u00f3rych praw konsument\\u00f3w oraz odpowiedzialno\\u015bci za szkod\\u0119 wyrz\\u0105dzon\\u0105 przez produkt niebezpieczny (Dz. U. nr 22, poz. 271 ze zm.).<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">6. Regulamin obowi\\u0105zuje od dnia 22.03.2013roku.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">Za\\u0142\\u0105cznik nr.1<\\/p><p align=\\\"right\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026..\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026.<\\/p><p align=\\\"right\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><em>Miejscowo\\u015b\\u0107, data<\\/em><\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">Kupuj\\u0105cy:<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026.<\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026\\u2026.<\\/p><p align=\\\"right\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p><p align=\\\"right\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">Sprzedawca:<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"right\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">ARES R.E.Wawrowscy Sp.J.<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"right\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">ul.\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">Cie\\u015blewskich 37Z<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"right\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">03-017 Warszawa<\\/span><\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/p><p align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">O\\u015aWIADCZENIE O ODST\\u0104PIENIU OD UMOWY ZAWARTEJ NA ODLEG\\u0141O\\u015a\\u0106<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; bor