;\\\">Tematy oko\\u0142o winiarskie<\\/a><\\/span><\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#242424\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"gqcbjdi\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"20\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"7uim9om\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; font-size: 14px; background: #ffffff; color: #757575; font-family: \'DM Sans\', sans-serif;\\\"><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.winohobby.biz\\/index.php?cat_id=114\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; color: #606060; text-decoration-line: none;\\\"><span title=\\\"Przechowywanie wina\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">Przec<\\/span><\\/a><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\"><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.winohobby.biz\\/index.php?cat_id=114\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; color: #606060; text-decoration-line: none;\\\">howywanie wina<\\/a>.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; font-size: 14px; background: #ffffff; color: #757575; font-family: \'DM Sans\', sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">Je\\u017cel<\\/span><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">i chcem<\\/span><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">y p<\\/span><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">rze<\\/span><span style=\\\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: none 0px; background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\\\">chowywa\\u0107 wina kupne jak i te domowe wina, powinni\\u015bmy zapewni\\u0107 im odpowiednie warunki.<\\/span>\\u00a0Warunki s\\u0105 tym bardziej istotne im d\\u0142u\\u017cej chcemy przechowywa\\u0107 wino. Do 3-5-8 miesi\\u0119cy, warunki nie maj\\u0105 tak bardzo istotnego wp\\u0142ywu, wystarcz\\u0105 normalne domowe warunki. Ale je\\u017celi zamierzamy \\u201ezbiera\\u0107\\u201d, le\\u017cakowa\\u0107 wina na 2-3 i wi\\u0119cej lat, trzeba stworzy\\u0107 odpowiednie warunki. Na tak d\\u0142ugie przechowywanie wina wszystkie czynniki mog\\u0105 mie\\u0107 znaczenie: jakie rega\\u0142y wybierzemy, jaka jest wilgotno\\u015b\\u0107 powietrza, jaka jest temperatura, czy jest odpowiednia wentylacja.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"7gitebv\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"40\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"trdh7zo\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<style>\\r\\n    .highlighted-link-blog-menu {\\r\\n        color: #757575;\\r\\n        transition: color 0.3s ease;\\r\\n        font-size: 13px;\\r\\n        padding: 8px 0;\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n<\\/style>\\r\\n\\r\\n<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/localhost:8443\\/content\\/13-filmy-o-zaprawkach-i-drinkach\\\" class=\\\"highlighted-link-blog-menu\\\">\\r\\n    <u>czytaj ca\\u0142o\\u015b\\u0107 \\u00bb <\\/u>\\r\\n<\\/a>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"pan2kqu\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"20\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1w0t9p4\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"20\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"nqwhmar\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_inline_size\":\"24.858\",\"_column_size\":50},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"yagr